abstract: "A comprehensive repository of Biblical characters with spiritual profiles, visual representations, biographical information, and maps of traits, corrections, and soul purposes. The goal is to transform all Biblical characters into a living series of spiritual Avatars, each learned, understood, experienced, and designed as a model for personal development."

